 **Knockout**: Seeded single-elimination bracket with automatic byes for non-power-of-two counts.
 
+Knockout completion rule:
+- A bracket match with a tied numeric score cannot be completed as an ordinary regulation result.
+- Record the resolution as overtime, tiebreak, forfeit, walkover, or administrative decision and select the advancing team explicitly.
+- The advancing team must be one of the two teams in the match.
+- Winner and loser progression then uses that explicit decision, so downstream bracket matches never remain unresolved after a completed tie.
